WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs","member":"ProcedureConfigControl.CheckModelXmlIntact","sha256":"36be1620196c60a72efb03dab8afb4fa302ba1ba8ec4acf7eb1f5f61883678bd","start":783,"end":805,"excerpt":"\tprivate bool CheckModelXmlIntact(IVmModule module)\n\t{\n\t\ttry\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tif (module == null)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\treturn false;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tif (!Directory.Exists(module.ModuleDir) || !File.Exists(module.ModuleDir + \"\\\\\" + module.ModuleTypeName + \".xml\") || !File.Exists(module.ModuleDir + \"\\\\\" + module.ModuleTypeName + \"AlgorithmTab.xml\") || !File.Exists(module.ModuleDir + \"\\\\\" + module.ModuleTypeName + \"Display.xml\"))\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\treturn false;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn true;\n\t\t}\n\t\tcatch (Exception ex)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tLogHelper.Error(\"CheckModelXmlIntact error: \" + ex.Message + \"\\r\\n\" + ex.StackTrace);\n\t\t\treturn false;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\tprivate TabWinBase GetExternTabWin(IVmModule vmModule)\n\t{","evidenceType":"local-decompiled-source","binaryIdentity":"not revalidated in this slice"}],"unknowns":[],"verification":{"method":"static resource, body and call-site inspection","runtimeExecuted":false,"nativeEquivalent":false}},{"id":"P03","route":"原版 · 两种参数窗入口","classification":"source-confirmed","from":"GetExternTabWin","to":"Control 程序集发现 / 首个 TabWinBase 类型","behavior":"先按 ModuleTypeName+Control 查已加载程序集，未得则试参数目录的 Control.dll 并 ActivatorWrap.LoadAssembly，随后查常规名/截断 C 的备用名。取首个可赋给 TabWinBase 的类型实例；这是具体动态入口，不代表所有安装扩展已枚举。","refs":[{"path":"analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs","member":"ProcedureConfigControl.GetExternTabWin","sha256":"36be1620196c60a72efb03dab8afb4fa302ba1ba8ec4acf7eb1f5f61883678bd","start":804,"end":831,"excerpt":"\tprivate TabWinBase GetExternTabWin(IVmModule vmModule)\n\t{\n\t\tstring moduleName = vmModule.ModuleTypeName;\n\t\tAssembly assembly = AppDomain.CurrentDomain.GetAssemblies().FirstOrDefault((Assembly p) => string.Equals(p.GetName().Name, moduleName + \"Control\"));\n\t\tif (assembly == null)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tstring text = Path.GetDirectoryName(vmModule.Params.XmlPath) + \"\\\\\" + moduleName + \"Control.dll\";\n\t\t\tif (File.Exists(text))\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tActivatorWrap.LoadAssembly(text);\n\t\t\t\tassembly = AppDomain.CurrentDomain.GetAssemblies().FirstOrDefault((Assembly p) => string.Equals(p.GetName().Name, moduleName + \"Control\")) ?? AppDomain.CurrentDomain.GetAssemblies().FirstOrDefault((Assembly p) => string.Equals(p.GetName().Name, moduleName.Remove(moduleName.LastIndexOf('C')) + \"Control\"));\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tif (assembly != null)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tList\u003cType> list = (from p in assembly.GetTypes()\n\t\t\t\twhere typeof(TabWinBase).IsAssignableFrom(p)\n\t\t\t\tselect p).ToList();\n\t\t\tif (list.Count > 0)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\treturn ActivatorWrap.CreateInstance(list[0]) as TabWinBase;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn null;\n\t}\n\n\tprivate void CurTabControlBase_Closed(object sender, EventArgs e)\n\t{","evidenceType":"local-decompiled-source","binaryIdentity":"not revalidated in this slice"}],"unknowns":[],"verification":{"method":"static resource, body and call-site inspection","runtimeExecuted":false,"nativeEquivalent":false}},{"id":"P04","route":"原版 · 两种参数窗入口","classification":"source-confirmed","from":"扩展窗口或 ParamsTabControlBase","to":"ParamsConfig / ROI / Owner / Show","behavior":"GetExternTabWin 为空才通用回退；设置 ROIPartUI、编辑状态、ParamsConfig，Owner 取所在窗或主窗，无 Application 时用 HwndSource；启用 modeless keyboard interop 后 Show，再置 IsOpenParams 和 curTabControlBase 并弱订阅 Closed。","refs":[{"path":"analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF/ProcedureConfigControl.xaml.cs","member":"ProcedureConfigControl window creation and publication","sha256":"36be1620196c60a72efb03dab8afb4fa302ba1ba8ec4acf7eb1f5f61883678bd","start":739,"end":771,"excerpt":"\t\t\tTabWinBase tabWinBase2 = GetExternTabWin(vmModule) ?? new ParamsTabControlBase();\n\t\t\ttabWinBase2.ROIPartUI = partUI;\n\t\t\ttabWinBase2.IsEditState = IsParamsEditState;\n\t\t\tLo