urce : data) as IVmModule;\n\t\tif (!vmModule.ConfigAvailable && (loginUser == AccessUser.Tech || loginUser == AccessUser.Operator))\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tflag = false;\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn flag && vmModule.ConfigCheck;\n\t}","evidenceType":"local-decompiled-source","binaryIdentity":"not revalidated in this slice"},{"path":"analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/VmModuleDecorator.cs","member":"decorator gate without ConfigCheck","sha256":"fcf5adfaf9cc6422e9f12b3ff19a3d880a5ef6ef4174fe8dfa5355fc31c7c9e4","start":350,"end":360,"excerpt":"\tpublic bool CanOpenConfigurationInterface()\n\t{\n\t\tbool result = true;\n\t\tAccessUser loginUser = CodeManager.Instance.GetLoginUser();\n\t\tif (IsForbidden || (IsLoadFailed ?? false) || (!VMModule.ConfigAvailable && (loginUser == AccessUser.Tech || loginUser == AccessUser.Operator)))\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tresult = false;\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn result;\n\t}\n","evidenceType":"local-decompiled-source","binaryIdentity":"not revalidated in this slice"}],"unknowns":["实际装饰器/模块接收者、角色变化、空输入及全部调用者仍未齐；两谓词差异不是运行权限绕过证明，P08/P09上游与其它调用入口分别保留。"],"verification":{"method":"static resource, body and call-site inspection","runtimeExecuted":false,"nativeEquivalent":false}},{"id":"P13","route":"原版 · 配置权限与虚拟前置检查","classification":"source-confirmed","from":"VmModule.ConfigCheck / 选定IMVSGroup继承链","to":"基类恒true；Group/ModuleSet未覆盖该getter","behavior":"原件VmModule.get_ConfigCheck只有ldc.i4.1;ret。完整选定TypeDef的声明getter及MethodImpl记录显示IMVSGroup→VmModuleSet→VmModule，两中间类没有ConfigCheck getter或相应MethodImpl覆盖。因此接收者确为该IMVSGroup且无更派生覆盖时继承true；注释提到密码/初始化并不等于该基类真的做了校验。VmGroupDecorator独立密码命令P10不能据名自动接进这条虚拟getter链。","refs":[{"path":"docs/architecture-recovery/config-check-cil-evidence.json","member":"VM.Core.VmModule::get_ConfigCheck","sha256":"d796a1bf2ba86c48dee5a4af00c4ad96cf9ad79607d2535a56e4ed1f66ee179f","start":1133,"end":1152,"excerpt":"          \"token\": \"0x06000278\",\n          \"symbol\": {\n            \"token\": \"0x06000278\",\n            \"kind\": \"method-