类型空保护或本体catch。此路径与普通Button的WPF命令处理不能自动合并。对P08画布的默认DelegateCommand\u003cobject>谓词为true这一选择可衔接，但不能外推其它命令的null查询也等价。","refs":[{"path":"docs/architecture-recovery/attached-event-cil-evidence.json","member":"Apps.UIHelper.Attach.AttachedRoutedEvent::Control_MouseDoubleClick","sha256":"1895e29312d85f6327ab657c774a1256d0bac958b7f85b00c3124f4c3e45163d","start":67,"end":86,"excerpt":"          \"token\": \"0x06000101\",\n          \"symbol\": {\n            \"token\": \"0x06000101\",\n            \"kind\": \"method-def\",\n            \"type\": \"Apps.UIHelper.Attach.AttachedRoutedEvent\",\n            \"name\": \"Control_MouseDoubleClick\",\n            \"parameters\": 2,\n            \"attributes\": \"Private, Static, HideBySig\",\n            \"signatureBytes\": \"0002011c1265\"\n          },\n          \"status\": \"decoded\",\n          \"issue\": null,\n          \"ilSize\": 61,\n          \"ilSha256\": \"3b94b74cdb9a25322cd7d1f1c2fb31c6b6b43ae5dee50a5108d3bd3ebdbe1e43\",\n          \"ilBytes\": \"000375710000010a06176f1601000a000275340000010b0728070100060c0728090100060d08146f1701000a130411042c0a0008096fec00000a00002a\",\n          \"instructions\": [\n            {\n              \"offset\": 0,\n              \"label\": \"IL_0000\",\n              \"opcode\": \"nop\",","evidenceType":"original-managed-cil","binaryIdentity":"be53f11087a4bcd338530edc283ca49a37d595bfd1a64c6f67232c007cfa189c / MVID 97956edd-673b-4408-b28e-5531ce60102e"},{"path":"docs/architecture-recovery/attached-event-cil-evidence.json","member":"Apps.UIHelper.Attach.AttachedRoutedEventBase::GetCommand","sha256":"1895e29312d85f6327ab657c774a1256d0bac958b7f85b00c3124f4c3e45163d","start":990,"end":1009,"excerpt":"          \"token\": \"0x06000107\",\n          \"symbol\": {\n            \"token\": \"0x06000107\",\n            \"kind\": \"method-def\",\n            \"type\": \"Apps.UIHelper.Attach.AttachedRoutedEventBase\",\n            \"name\": \"GetCommand\",\n            \"parameters\": 1,\n           