19","route":"原版 · 原BAML离线提取映射","classification":"source-confirmed","from":"选定procedureconfigcontrol / diagramitemtemplate原载荷","to":"离线输出逐字节对应现有流程/画布XAML","behavior":"使用仓库已有ilspycmd 11.1.0.9782的单资源--resource模式、禁用更新检查，从已核REA资源摘要的原件定向提取。流程配置与画布模板两输出分别与既有本地XAML全文件逐字节一致；原载荷/工具/输出/本地文件摘要及退出状态保留。选定离线输出包含设置按钮的Command/Click、两处DiagramArea.ItemDoubleClick委托值，以及MODULE附加双击声明。因此这些有限声明的来源现可接回具体原载荷，而不再只有无原件关联的本地提取文件。","refs":[{"path":"docs/architecture-recovery/baml-decoded/wpf/procedureconfigcontrol.xaml","member":"original BAML-derived procedure button","sha256":"a91f89dd2214f3b4cc3ad432d14caf8732d11bc376b29c64ad1b8a75a982f106","start":317,"end":317,"excerpt":"        \u003ccommomcontrol:SuperImageButton ToolTip=\"{DynamicResource Lang_SetCnfg}\" Margin=\"0,0,0,0\" Command=\"{Binding ConfigParamsCommand, RelativeSource={RelativeSource Mode=FindAncestor, AncestorType=local:ProcedureConfigControl}}\" CommandParameter=\"{Binding DisplayModuleSet}\" Click=\"SuperImageButton_Click\">","evidenceType":"original-baml-offline-ilspy-extraction","binaryIdentity":"99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / payload b3f3afbc360f55bdf51702a54de920faf4a1d61f826003c5895d5c0c035d12e8 / ilspycmd 11.1.0.9782"},{"path":"docs/architecture-recovery/baml-selected-decode.json","member":"Payload, tool invocation, output and local byte-identity proof","sha256":"8c14951ef5806966c971c08074ad78a4b77bad63597701cbc1525a6c98c14836","start":31,"end":65,"excerpt":"      \"resourceKey\": \"procedureconfigcontrol.baml\",\n      \"payloadSha256\": \"b3f3afbc360f55bdf51702a54de920faf4a1d61f826003c5895d5c0c035d12e8\",\n      \"payloadByteLength\": 24018,\n      \"toolArguments\": [\n        \"--disable-updatecheck\",\n        \"--resource\",\n        \"VMControls.WPF.g.resources/procedureconfigcontrol.baml\",\n        \"-o\",\n        \"D:\\\\MyWork\\\\REA逆向测试\\\\docs\\\\architecture-recovery\\\\baml-decoded\\\\wpf\",\n        \"D:\\\\Program Files\\\\VisionMaster4.4.0\\\\Applications\\\\myLibs\