","classification":"source-confirmed","from":"OnProcedureChanged / OnApplyTemplate→UpdateCalibGuide","to":"数据/模式分支 → 引导页/按钮，但清理规则不同","behavior":"两入口对CalibrationData为byte[]时new CalibrationGuideData并loadXml，正常返回后替换数据并设Parent。有数据且IsBootMode=true时取引导页，Guide非null且页实现IGuidePage才设Owner/CurDiagram，Dispose旧可释放子项、Clear、GC.Collect、Add新页；按钮更新仍在该有效页条件之外，流程按钮IsEnabled另TwoWay绑定到该页CanChangeMode。有数据且非引导模式时，OnProcedureChanged清旧页并GC后切按钮，UpdateCalibGuide只切按钮、不清旧页。无数据时两者清页并隐藏两按钮；不合类型时UpdateCalibGuide直接返回，而OnProcedureChanged的非装饰器分支会清页/隐藏，不能合为同一幂等刷新。","refs":[{"path":"docs/architecture-recovery/guide-mode-cil-evidence.json","member":"VMControls.WPF.Base.DiagramArea::OnProcedureChanged","sha256":"4422a8dcb470ec14fa49c50d5002cba370dfaee77085b88063443203ae7932b0","start":1227,"end":1246,"excerpt":"          \"token\": \"0x06000b24\",\n          \"symbol\": {\n            \"token\": \"0x06000b24\",\n            \"kind\": \"method-def\",\n            \"type\": \"VMControls.WPF.Base.DiagramArea\",\n            \"name\": \"OnProcedureChanged\",\n            \"parameters\": 2,\n            \"attributes\": \"Private, Static, HideBySig\",\n            \"signatureBytes\": \"000201128105118109\"\n          },\n          \"status\": \"decoded\",\n          \"issue\": null,\n          \"ilSize\": 1091,\n          \"ilSha256\": \"d085adfd18500c29bdfe0d493d7b4499d8ea06810f3050571abbbfb98239e7ac\",\n          \"ilBytes\": \"\",\n          \"instructions\": [\n            {\n              \"offset\": 0,\n              \"label\": \"IL_0000\",\n              \"opcode\": \"nop\",","evidenceType":"original-managed-cil","binaryIdentity":"99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d"},{"path":"docs/architecture-recovery/guide-mode-cil-evidence.json","member":"VMControls.WPF.Base.DiagramArea::UpdateCalibGuide","sha256":"4422a8dcb470ec14fa49c50d5002cba370dfaee77085b88063443203ae7932b0","start":5207,"end":5226,"excerpt":"          \"token\": \"0x06000b