\t\t{\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\t/// \u003csummary>\n\t/// 流程忙碌\n\t/// \u003c/summary>\n\tinternal void InvokeOnWorkBeginStatusCallBack(object result, uint excuteCount)","evidenceType":"local-decompiled-source","binaryIdentity":"not revalidated in this slice"}],"unknowns":["Init全部创建/重载调用者、实例是否复用、UserData读分支及异常后的实际字段值未齐；有效XML与对象解析仍在画布P23路径，不把非null字节当合法引导数据证明。Core体为独立CIL加REA身份，未逐方法REA匹配。"],"verification":{"method":"static resource, body and call-site inspection","runtimeExecuted":false,"nativeEquivalent":false}},{"id":"P29","route":"原版 · 引导数据装载与方案保存触发","classification":"source-confirmed","from":"ProjectManager保存预备 / ToolControl保存预备","to":"Dispatcher调用SaveCalibUserData → 逐流程SaveCalibData回调","behavior":"主菜单ProjectManager的两种SaveSolution路径经Application.Current.Dispatcher.Invoke零参委托调用SaveCalibUserData；两个闭包原件体都只调用该方法。它枚举VmSolution.Instance.Modules.OfType\u003cVmProcedure>，逐项接口SaveCalibData，不主动递归或遍历AllModules；无单项异常catch，回调抛错会阻断后续项与调用者正常延续，枚举器finally只负责释放。外部ToolControl有自己的同名循环及Dispatcher预备阶段，已有global-toolbar:G13原件体可接入。两者均可连接P27的字段空值/可选保存委托分支，不能把调用回调等同最终文件导出成功。","refs":[{"path":"docs/architecture-recovery/guide-storage-cil-evidence.json","member":"VisionMaster.Project.ProjectManager::SaveCalibUserData","sha256":"35f49642b76b595309ea386c12d1cbf18dbd9269acef1cf43d925818fa95b62e","start":2393,"end":2412,"excerpt":"          \"token\": \"0x0600014a\",\n          \"symbol\": {\n            \"token\": \"0x0600014a\",\n            \"kind\": \"method-def\",\n            \"type\": \"VisionMaster.Project.ProjectManager\",\n            \"name\": \"SaveCalibUserData\",\n            \"parameters\": 0,\n            \"attributes\": \"Private, HideBySig\",\n            \"signatureBytes\": \"200001\"\n          },\n          \"status\": \"decoded\",\n          \"issue\": null,\n          \"ilSize\": 63,\n          \"ilSha256\": \"39011f58e946b939d6f4ecc89fadf9dc3d08d2913014f4e0d64413d5f25e7318\",\n          \"ilBytes\": \"0000288800000a6feb00000a280400002b6fe801000a0a2b10066fe901000a0b00076fea01000a00000