:"static resource, body and call-site inspection","runtimeExecuted":false,"nativeEquivalent":false}},{"id":"P36","route":"原版 · 显示类型、样式与配置/导航门","classification":"source-confirmed","from":"VmModuleBaseDecorator静态构造","to":"CurrentPathHelper路径 + ModulePathGenerate.txt → 类型名共享表","behavior":"静态构造先new显示类型字典，再StreamReader读取GetCurrentPath()+ModulePathGenerate.txt；逐行按精确分隔串“ # ”拆分，以首列为键，缺键才读取第三列并Replace全部大写ADORNER，再Enum.TryParse，空/失败回落NORMAL，重复键保留先项。没有File.Exists、列数门或catch；StreamReader finally释放不能当缺文件/坏行后继续getter回退的保证。已保存安装目录候选文本的原路径/摘要与191行快照（首列唯一、无短行），但未证明运行GetCurrentPath选择该文件。","refs":[{"path":"docs/architecture-recovery/display-type-cil-evidence.json","member":"VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.VmModuleBaseDecorator::.cctor","sha256":"fcd9746c400807513768c9e6a3c53fa4510b461677dc221580f86d12076786db","start":669,"end":688,"excerpt":"          \"token\": \"0x0600099e\",\n          \"symbol\": {\n            \"token\": \"0x0600099e\",\n            \"kind\": \"method-def\",\n            \"type\": \"VMControls.WPF.DataForUI.VmModuleBaseDecorator\",\n            \"name\": \".cctor\",\n            \"parameters\": 0,\n            \"attributes\": \"Private, Static, HideBySig, SpecialName, RTSpecialName\",\n            \"signatureBytes\": \"000001\"\n          },\n          \"status\": \"decoded\",\n          \"issue\": null,\n          \"ilSize\": 246,\n          \"ilSha256\": \"61f5203bb7c63510d2db3e032ce27b377d6442424ec20cee89d55d5c12334ce7\",\n          \"ilBytes\": \"\",\n          \"instructions\": [\n            {\n              \"offset\": 0,\n              \"label\": \"IL_0000\",\n              \"opcode\": \"newobj\",","evidenceType":"original-managed-cil","binaryIdentity":"99ffa401c8784472913ad43813d68a8a5577890c00e149506e3e5664fa61c97d / MVID d144317f-3992-4275-9b0f-13fb6163e07d"},{"path":"analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/VmModuleBaseDecorator.cs","member":"static display table population","sha256":"f124b9a5e3ce5b8e2e856d3e325b00a4b143f7074513ccc74d542ec35c2695dd","start":485,"end":514,"excerpt":"\tstatic VmModuleBaseDecorator()\n\t{\n\t\tdisplayTypeDic = new Dictionary\u003cstring, ModuleDisplayType>();\n\t\tHasCheckPath = new Dictionary\u003cuint, uint>();\n\t\tLogHelper.Info(\"------yytest----------displaytype获取前\");\n\t\tstring text = \"\";\n\t\tstring currentPath = CurrentPathHelper.Instance.GetCurrentPath();\n\t\tusing (StreamReader streamReader = new StreamReader(currentPath + \"ModulePathGenerate.txt\"))\n\t\t{\n\t\t\twhile ((text = streamReader.ReadLine()) != null)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tstring[] array = text.Split(new string[1] { \" # \" }, StringSplitOptions.None);\n\t\t\t\tif (!displayTypeDic.ContainsKey(array[0]))\n\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\tModuleDisplayType value = ModuleDisplayType.NORMAL;\n\t\t\t\t\tstring value2 = array[2].Replace(\"ADORNER\", \"\");\n\t\t\t\t\tModuleDisplayType result;\n\t\t\t\t\tif (string.IsNullOrEmpty(value2))\n\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\tvalue = ModuleDisplayType.NORMAL;\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\telse if (Enum.TryParse\u003cModuleDisplayType>(value2, out result))\n\t\t\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\t\t\tvalue = result;\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t\tdisplayTypeDic.Add(array[0], value);\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tLogHelper.Info(\"------yytest----------displaytype获取后\");","evidenceType":"local-decompiled-source","binaryIdentity":"not revalidated in this slice"},{"path":"docs/architecture-recovery/display-type-installed-table.json","member":"Installed candidate resource identity","sha256":"b73ea780c03c4f24e930cc6cfc93720b1f7e55026946442e8602f7733ebe51d8","start":3,"end":6,"excerpt":"  \"path\": \"D:/Program Files/VisionMaster4.4.0/Applications/ModulePathGenerate.txt\",\n  \"sha256\": \"031c49c111c921850b65fd8ca701b66bc9d8c238caf6dbf7a137cedd833eaa07\",\n  \"byteLength\": 15229,\n  \"rows\": [","evidenceType":"local-decompiled-source","binaryIdentity":"not revalidated in this slice"}],"unknowns":["CurrentPathHelper选定原件分支已核P40–P43；实际宿主配置/标志、注册表、选中文本、内容/类型初始化失败影响仍未运行验证。191行是候选快照，不是入口或插件覆盖率。"],"verification":{"meth